\section*{Conduction through a Plate separating Two Media.}

317.] Let us next consider the effect of a plate of thickness
 $A B$ of a medium whose
 resistance is $k_{2}$, and
 separating two media
 whose resistances are
 $k_{1}$ and $k_{3}$, in altering
 the potential due to a
 source $S$ in the first
 medium.


